          "name": "show stuff2",
          "rect": {
            "left": 474,
            "top": 0,
            "right": 512,
            "bottom": 12
          },
          "script": "on mouseUp\nif not inBackground() then exit mouseUp\n\nrepeat with i = 1 to the number of bg buttons\nif \"_\" is in short name of bg button i then\nhide bg button i\nend if\nend repeat\nrepeat with i = 1 to the number of bg fields\nif \"_\" is in short name of bg field i then\nhide bg field i\nend if\nend repeat\nend mouseUp",
