      "script": "on handleCompositeButtonMouseDown buttonList, message, target\nput rect of button (item 1 of buttonList) into buttonRect\nput false into selected\n\nrepeat while the mouse is down\nput the mouseLoc is within buttonRect into selected\nsetCompositeButtonHilite buttonList, selected\nwait 1\nend repeat\n\nsetCompositeButtonHilite buttonList, false\n\nif selected then\nsend message to target\nend if\nend handleCompositeButtonMouseDown\n\non setCompositeButtonHilite buttonList, value\nrepeat with i = 1 to the number of items of buttonList\nset hilite of button (item i of buttonList) to value\nend repeat\nend setCompositeButtonHilite\n\non centerItem\nwait until the mouseClick\n\nrepeat with i = 1 to the number of buttons\nif the clickLoc is within rect of button i then\nset loc of button i to 256, (item 2 of loc of button i)\nend if\nend repeat\n\nrepeat with i = 1 to the number of card fields\nif the clickLoc is within rect of card field i then\nset loc of card field i to 256, (item 2 of loc of card field i)\nend if\nend repeat\nend centerItem\n\non shiftItems\nset cursor to cross\nwait until the mouseClick\nput the clickLoc into p1\nwait until the mouseClick\nput the clickLoc into p2\n\nput min(item 1 of p1, item 1 of p2) & \",\" & ¬\nmin(item 2 of p1, item 2 of p2) & \",\" & ¬\nmax(item 1 of p1, item 1 of p2) & \",\" & ¬\nmax(item 2 of p1, item 2 of p2) into r\n\nput empty into targetButtons\nput empty into targetFields\n\nrepeat with i = 1 to the number of buttons\nif visible of button i and loc of button i is within r and ¬\nleft of button i ≥ item 1 of r and ¬\ntop of button i ≥ item 2 of r and ¬\nright of button i ≤ item 3 of r and ¬\nbottom of button i ≤ item 4 of r then\nput space & i after targetButtons\nend if\nend repeat\nrepeat with i = 1 to the number of card fields\nif visible of card field i and loc of card field i is within r and ¬\nleft of card field i ≥ item 1 of r and ¬\ntop of card field i ≥ item 2 of r and ¬\nright of card field i ≤ item 3 of r and ¬\nbottom of card field i ≤ item 4 of r then\nput space & i after targetFields\nend if\nend repeat\n\nset cursor to watch\n\nrepeat\nput 0 into dx\nput 0 into dy\n\nrepeat\nput checkKeys(\"left,up,right,down\") into arrows\nif arrows ≠ \"false,false,false,false\" then exit repeat\nif the mouseClick then\nflush keys\nexit shiftItems\nend if\nwait 1\nend repeat\n\nif item 1 of arrows then\nput -1 into dx\nend if\nif item 2 of arrows then\nput -1 into dy\nend if\nif item 3 of arrows then\nput 1 into dx\nend if\nif item 4 of arrows then\nput 1 into dy\nend if\nif the shiftKey is down then\nmultiply dx by 5\nmultiply dy by 5\nend if\n\nrepeat with i = 1 to the number of words of targetButtons\nput word i of targetButtons into ii\nset topLeft of button ii to ¬\nleft of button ii + dx,top of button ii + dy\nend repeat\nrepeat with i = 1 to the number of words of targetFields\nput word i of targetFields into ii\nset topLeft of card field ii to ¬\nleft of card field ii + dx,top of card field ii + dy\nend repeat\n\nrepeat\nput checkKeys(\"left,up,right,down\") into arrows\nif arrows = \"false,false,false,false\" then exit repeat\nif the mouseClick then\nflush keys\nexit shiftItems\nend if\nwait 1\nend repeat\nend repeat\nend shiftItems\n",
