          "text_font": "Palatino",
          "text_size": 10,
          "text_style": "plain",
          "text_align": "Left",
          "contents": "To Frank Seide, author of Sound-Trecker, I also owe you a shareware fee and/or a souvenir from my home town for your excellent Sound-Trecker drivers. If you're still out there too, I hope we can connect so I can send you something fun.",
