    {
      "id": 9571,
      "name": "settings",
      "script": "on openCard\npositionVolumeSlider\nset visible of card field \"sound warning\" to ¬\nnot the hilite of button \"Sound FX\"\nupdateSpeedrunStuff\npass openCard\nend openCard\n\non updateSpeedrunStuff\nput getSpeedrunModeEnabled() into speedrunModeEnabled\nset enabled of button id 36 to speedrunModeEnabled\nset enabled of button id 45 to speedrunModeEnabled\nend updateSpeedrunStuff\n\non mouseUp\nput safeClickedButtonId() into buttonId\nif buttonId is empty then exit mouseUp\n\nput button id buttonId into controlName\nif char 1 to 8 of controlName ≠ \"control_\" then exit mouseUp\n\nif the optionKey is down then\nset name of button id buttonId to \"(Unset)\"\nsetControl controlName, empty\nexit mouseUp\nend if\n\nput the short name of button id buttonId into oldKeyName\n\nset hilite of button id buttonId to true\nset name of button id buttonId to \"Press a key...\"\nset textFont of button id buttonId to \"Geneva\"\nset textSize of button id buttonId to 10\n\nrepeat until the mouseClick\nput firstKeyDown() into keyCode\n\nif keyCode ≠ empty then\nput keyCode into keyName\nexit repeat\nend if\n\nwait 2\nend repeat\n\nflush keys\nif keyCode is not empty then\nif isKeyAlreadyBound(keyName) then\nset name of button id buttonId to \"Already used!\"\nwait 1 second\nset name of button id buttonId to oldKeyName\nelse\nset name of button id buttonId to keyName\nsetControl controlName, keyCode\nend if\nelse\nset name of button id buttonId to oldKeyName\nend if\n\nset hilite of button id buttonId to false\nset textFont of button id buttonId to \"Chicago\"\nset textSize of button id buttonId to 12\nend mouseUp\n\nfunction isKeyAlreadyBound keyName\nrepeat with i = 1 to the number of buttons\nif char 1 to 8 of button i ≠ \"control_\" then next repeat\nif the short name of button i = keyName then return true\nend repeat\n\nreturn false\nend isKeyAlreadyBound\n\non setControl controlName, keyCode\nif controlName = \"control_left\" then\nput keyCode into item 1 of card field \"controls\" of card \"game\"\nend if\nif controlName = \"control_right\" then\nput keyCode into item 2 of card field \"controls\" of card \"game\"\nend if\nif controlName = \"control_bounce\" then\nput keyCode into item 3 of card field \"controls\" of card \"game\"\nend if\nif controlName = \"control_explode\" then\nput keyCode into item 4 of card field \"controls\" of card \"game\"\nend if\nif controlName = \"control_pause\" then\nput keyCode into item 5 of card field \"controls\" of card \"game\"\nend if\nif controlName = \"control_win\" then\nput keyCode into item 6 of card field \"controls\" of card \"game\"\nend if\nif controlName = \"control_reset\" then\nput keyCode into item 7 of card field \"controls\" of card \"game\"\nend if\nend setControl\n\n-- We can't rely on using \"the target\" to get the clicked\n-- button, because there may be buttons with the same name\n-- and it only returns the name of a button. This will return\n-- the unique id of whichever button was clicked.\nfunction safeClickedButtonId\nrepeat with i = 1 to the number of buttons\nif visible of button i and ¬\nthe clickLoc is within rect of button i then\nreturn id of button i\nend if\nend repeat\n\nreturn empty\nend safeClickedButtonId\n\non positionVolumeSlider\nput the soundVolume into currentVolume\nif currentVolume < 1 then put 1 into currentVolume\n\nset loc of button \"volumeSlider\" to 96 + currentVolume*12, ¬\nitem 2 of loc of button \"volumeSlider\"\nend positionVolumeSlider\n\non goBackToTitle\nput card field \"controls\" of card \"game\" into controls\n\nif item 1 of controls is empty or item 2 of controls is empty ¬\nor item 3 of controls is empty then\nanswer \"You haven't set all of the controls for playing the game! \" ¬\n& \"Do you really want to go back?\" with \"Yes?\" or \"No!!!\"\n\nif it is \"No!!!\" then exit goBackToTitle\n\nanswer \"If you insist!\" with \"Duh duh!\"\nend if\n\nlock screen\ngo to card \"title\"\nunlock screen with visual effect push right\nend goBackToTitle",
      "background": 4779,
      "parts": [
        {
          "id": 35,
          "kind": "Field",
          "name": "sound warning",
          "rect": {
            "left": 115,
            "top": 202,
