          },
          "script": "on mouseDown\nrepeat until the mouse is up\nput clamp(the mouseH, 108, 180) into x\nset loc of me to x, item 2 of loc of me\nend repeat\n\nput (item 1 of loc of me - 102) div 12 + 1 into newVol\nset the soundVolume to newVol\npositionVolumeSlider\n\nif hilite of button \"Sound FX\" then\nput \"death1,death2,death3,death4,death5,death6,death7,death8,\" & ¬\n\"lever1,lever2,spring1,spring2,spring3,spring4,spring5,\" & ¬\n\"checkpoint,spring6,ka-ching\" into sfx\nplay stop\nplay (item random(the number of items of sfx) of sfx)\nend if\nend mouseDown",
