        {
          "id": 264,
          "kind": "Button",
          "name": "play3",
          "rect": {
            "left": 465,
            "top": 21,
            "right": 512,
            "bottom": 33
          },
          "script": "function findConnectionIndexForTile tilePos, lineNum\nglobal maxConnections\nrepeat with i = 1 to maxConnections\nput connectionStorageButtonName(i) into storageName\n\nif tilePos & space is in line lineNum of button storageName then\nreturn i\nend if\nend repeat\n\nreturn empty\nend findConnectionIndexForTile\n\nfunction findActiveDoor activeDoorList, doorData\nrepeat with i = 1 to the number of words of activeDoorList\nput word i of activeDoorList into activeDoor\n\nif item 1 of activeDoor = item 1 of doorData and ¬\nitem 2 of activeDoor = item 2 of doorData then\nreturn i\nend if\nend repeat\n\nreturn 0\nend findActiveDoor\n\non triggerSwitch tilePos, tile\nput findConnectionIndexForTile(tilePos, 1) into index\n\nif index is empty then\nanswer \"Error! findConnectionIndexForTile(,1) is empty, tilePos:\" && tilePos\nexit triggerSwitch\nend if\n\nput connectionStorageButtonName(index) into storageName\nput word 1 of line 2 of button storageName into onStatus\nput word 2 of line 2 of button storageName into orgOnStatus\n\nif onStatus and tile = \"=\" or not onStatus and tile = \"+\" then\nexit triggerSwitch\nend if\n\nput not onStatus into word 1 of line 2 of button storageName\n\ntriggerConnection storageName, not onStatus\nend triggerSwitch\n\non moveSwitches switchList, onStatus\nrepeat with i = 1 to the number of words of switchList\nput word i of switchList into tile1Pos\nput (item 1 of word i of switchList & \",\" & ¬\nitem 2 of word i of switchList+1) into tile2Pos\n\nsetMapTile \"≠\", tile1Pos\nsetMapTile \"‘\", tile2Pos\n\nif onStatus then\naddAnimatingTile tile1Pos, \"+\", 2\naddAnimatingTile tile2Pos, \"}\", 2\nelse\naddAnimatingTile tile1Pos, \"=\", 2\naddAnimatingTile tile2Pos, \"]\", 2\nend if\nend repeat\nend moveSwitches\n\non triggerConnection storageName, onStatus\nglobal openingDoors, closingDoors\n\n-- answer \"opening:\" & return & openingDoors & return & \"closing:\" & return & ¬\n-- closingDoors\n\nput word 2 of line 2 of button storageName into orgOnStatus\nput openingDoors into newOpeningDoors\nput closingDoors into newClosingDoors\n\nmoveSwitches (line 1 of button storageName), onStatus\n\nrepeat with dir = 1 to 4\nif onStatus ≠ orgOnStatus then\n-- open the door!\nput line (1 + dir*2) of button storageName into unprocessedOpeningDoors\nput line (2 + dir*2) of button storageName into unprocessedClosingDoors\nelse\n-- close the door!\nput line (2 + dir*2) of button storageName into unprocessedOpeningDoors\nput line (1 + dir*2) of button storageName into unprocessedClosingDoors\nend if\n\nrepeat with i = 1 to the number of words of unprocessedOpeningDoors\nput word i of unprocessedOpeningDoors into door\nput findActiveDoor(line dir of newClosingDoors, door) into activeIndex\n\nif activeIndex = 0 then\nput door & \",\" & (((item 3 of door) - (item 2 of door)) * 2 + 1) ¬\n& space after line dir of newOpeningDoors\nelse\nput word activeIndex of line dir of newClosingDoors & space ¬\nafter line dir of newOpeningDoors\ndelete word activeIndex of line dir of newClosingDoors\nend if\nend repeat\n\nrepeat with i = 1 to the number of words of unprocessedClosingDoors\nput word i of unprocessedClosingDoors into door\nput findActiveDoor(line dir of newOpeningDoors, door) into activeIndex\n\nif activeIndex = 0 then\nput door & \",\" & 0 & space after line dir of newClosingDoors\nelse\nput word activeIndex of line dir of newOpeningDoors & space ¬\nafter line dir of newClosingDoors\ndelete word activeIndex of line dir of newOpeningDoors\nend if\nend repeat\nend repeat\n\nput newOpeningDoors into openingDoors\nput newClosingDoors into closingDoors\n-- answer \"opening:\" & return & openingDoors & return & \"closing:\" & return & ¬\n-- closingDoors\nend triggerConnection\n\non handleHorizontalOpeningDoors lineNum, midTile, endTile, isLeft\nglobal openingDoors\nput line lineNum of openingDoors into currentOpeningDoors\nput empty into newOpeningDoors\n\nrepeat with i = 1 to the number of words of currentOpeningDoors\nput word i of currentOpeningDoors into doorData\nput item 1 of doorData into y\nput item 2 of doorData into startX\nput item 3 of doorData into endX\nput item 4 of doorData into step\n\nput step div 2 into offsetX\nput step mod 2 into substep\n\nif isLeft then\nput endX-offsetX into currentX\nput endX-offsetX+1 into prevX\nelse\nput startX+offsetX into currentX\nput startX+offsetX-1 into prevX\nend if\n\nif substep = 1 then\n--setMapTile midTile, (currentX & \",\" & y)\nput midTile into char (currentX+(y-1)*27) of card field \"map\"\nelse\n--setMapTile \" \", (currentX & \",\" & y)\nput \" \" into char (currentX+(y-1)*27) of card field \"map\"\n\nif offsetX = 0 then\n-- Door has opened\nnext repeat\nend if\n\n--setMapTile endTile, (prevX & \",\" & y)\nput endTile into char (prevX+(y-1)*27) of card field \"map\"\nend if\n\nput (step-1) into item 4 of doorData\nput doorData & space after newOpeningDoors\nend repeat\n\nput newOpeningDoors into line lineNum of openingDoors\nend handleHorizontalOpeningDoors\n\non handleHorizontalClosingDoors lineNum, midTile, endTile, isLeft\nglobal closingDoors\nput empty into newClosingDoors\nput line lineNum of closingDoors into currentClosingDoors\n\nrepeat with i = 1 to the number of words of currentClosingDoors\nput word i of currentClosingDoors into doorData\nput item 1 of doorData into y\nput item 2 of doorData into startX\nput item 3 of doorData into endX\nput item 4 of doorData into step\n\nput step div 2 into offsetX\nput step mod 2 into substep\n\nif isLeft then\nput endX-offsetX into currentX\nput endX-offsetX+1 into prevX\nelse\nput startX+offsetX into currentX\nput startX+offsetX-1 into prevX\nend if\n\nif playerOverlappingTilePos(currentX, y) then\ndie\nend if\n\nif substep = 0 then\nif offsetX ≠ 0 then\n--setMapTile \"P\", (prevX & \",\" & y)\nput \"P\" into char (prevX+(y-1)*27) of card field \"map\"\nend if\n--setMapTile midTile, (currentX & \",\" & y)\nput midTile into char (currentX+(y-1)*27) of card field \"map\"\nelse\n--setMapTile endTile, (currentX & \",\" & y)\nput endTile into char (currentX+(y-1)*27) of card field \"map\"\n\nif offsetX = (endX-startX) then\n-- Door has opened\nnext repeat\nend if\nend if\n\nput (step+1) into item 4 of doorData\nput doorData & space after newClosingDoors\nend repeat\n\nput newClosingDoors into line lineNum of closingDoors\nend handleHorizontalClosingDoors\n\non handleVerticalOpeningDoors lineNum, midTile, endTile, isUp\nglobal openingDoors\n\nput line lineNum of openingDoors into currentOpeningDoors\nput empty into newOpeningDoors\n\nrepeat with i = 1 to the number of words of currentOpeningDoors\nput word i of currentOpeningDoors into doorData\nput item 1 of doorData into x\nput item 2 of doorData into startY\nput item 3 of doorData into endY\nput item 4 of doorData into step\n\nput step div 2 into offsetY\nput step mod 2 into substep\n\nif isUp then\nput endY-offsetY into currentY\nput endY-offsetY+1 into prevY\nelse\nput startY+offsetY into currentY\nput startY+offsetY-1 into prevY\nend if\n\nif substep = 1 then\n--setMapTile midTile, (x & \",\" & currentY)\nput midTile into char (x+(currentY-1)*27) of card field \"map\"\nelse\n--setMapTile \" \", (x & \",\" & currentY)\nput \" \" into char (x+(currentY-1)*27) of card field \"map\"\n\nif offsetY = 0 then\n-- Door has opened\nnext repeat\nend if\n\n--setMapTile endTile, (x & \",\" & prevY)\nput endTile into char (x+(prevY-1)*27) of card field \"map\"\nend if\n\nput (step-1) into item 4 of doorData\nput doorData & space after newOpeningDoors\nend repeat\n\nput newOpeningDoors into line lineNum of openingDoors\nend handleVerticalOpeningDoors\n\non handleVerticalClosingDoors lineNum, midTile, endTile, isUp\nglobal closingDoors\n\nput empty into newClosingDoors\nput line lineNum of closingDoors into currentClosingDoors\n\nrepeat with i = 1 to the number of words of currentClosingDoors\nput word i of currentClosingDoors into doorData\nput item 1 of doorData into x\nput item 2 of doorData into startY\nput item 3 of doorData into endY\nput item 4 of doorData into step\n\nput step div 2 into offsetY\nput step mod 2 into substep\n\nif isUp then\nput endY-offsetY into currentY\nput endY-offsetY+1 into prevY\nelse\nput startY+offsetY into currentY\nput startY+offsetY-1 into prevY\nend if\n\nif playerOverlappingTilePos(x, currentY) then\ndie\nend if\n\nif substep = 0 then\nif offsetY ≠ 0 then\n--setMapTile \"p\", (x & \",\" & prevY)\nput \"p\" into char (x+(prevY-1)*27) of card field \"map\"\nend if\n--setMapTile midTile, (x & \",\" & currentY)\nput midTile into char (x+(currentY-1)*27) of card field \"map\"\nelse\n--setMapTile endTile, (x & \",\" & currentY)\nput endTile into char (x+(currentY-1)*27) of card field \"map\"\n\nif offsetY = (endY-startY) then\n-- Door has opened\nnext repeat\nend if\nend if\n\nput (step+1) into item 4 of doorData\nput doorData & space after newClosingDoors\nend repeat\n\nput newClosingDoors into line lineNum of closingDoors\nend handleVerticalClosingDoors\n\non handleChangingDoors\nglobal openingDoors, closingDoors, lastDoorsMoving\nput false into doorsMoving\n\nif the number of chars of openingDoors > 4 then\nput true into doorsMoving\n-- left doors\nhandleHorizontalOpeningDoors 1, \"Ú\", \"…\", true\n-- up doors\nhandleVerticalOpeningDoors 2, \"”\", \"“\", true\n-- right doors\nhandleHorizontalOpeningDoors 3, \"Æ\", \"æ\", false\n-- down doors\nhandleVerticalOpeningDoors 4, \"¿\", \"÷\", false\nend if\n\nif the number of chars of closingDoors > 4 then\nput true into doorsMoving\n-- left doors\nhandleHorizontalClosingDoors 1, \"Ú\", \"…\", true\n-- up doors\nhandleVerticalClosingDoors 2, \"”\", \"“\", true\n-- right doors\nhandleHorizontalClosingDoors 3, \"Æ\", \"æ\", false\n-- down doors\nhandleVerticalClosingDoors 4, \"¿\", \"÷\", false\nend if\n\nif doorsMoving ≠ lastDoorsMoving then\nif doorsMoving then\nstartMovingPlatformFX\nelse\nstopMovingPlatformFX\nend if\nend if\n\nput doorsMoving into lastDoorsMoving\nend handleChangingDoors\n\non handleAnimatingTiles\nglobal animatingTiles\n\nif animatingTiles is empty then\nexit handleAnimatingTiles\nend if\n\nput empty into newAnimatingTiles\n\nrepeat with i = 1 to the number of words of animatingTiles\nput word i of animatingTiles into buttonData\n\nif item 4 of buttonData = \"1\" then\nsetMapTile item 3 of buttonData, (item 1 to 2 of buttonData)\nnext repeat\nend if\n\nsubtract 1 from item 4 of buttonData\nput buttonData & space after newAnimatingTiles\nend repeat\n\nput newAnimatingTiles into animatingTiles\nend handleAnimatingTiles\n\non triggerButton tilePos, buttonTurnsOn\nif buttonTurnsOn then\nput findConnectionIndexForTile(tilePos, 11) into index\nelse\nput findConnectionIndexForTile(tilePos, 12) into index\nend if\n\nif index is empty then\nanswer \"Error! findConnectionIndexForTile(,11|12) is empty, tilePos:\" && tilePos\nexit triggerButton\nend if\n\nput connectionStorageButtonName(index) into storageName\nput word 1 of line 2 of button storageName into onStatus\n\nif onStatus = buttonTurnsOn then\nexit triggerButton\nend if\n\nput not onStatus into word 1 of line 2 of button storageName\n\ntriggerConnection storageName, not onStatus\nend triggerButton\n\n\non thingy blah1, blah2\nanswer blah1 && blah2\nend thingy",
          "visible": false,
          "style": "Transparent",
          "text_font": "Geneva",
          "text_size": 9,
          "text_style": "plain",
          "text_align": "Center",
          "contents": "",
          "hilite": false,
          "auto_hilite": false,
          "show_name": false,
          "enabled": true,
          "family": 0,
          "shared_hilite": true,
          "icon": 0,
          "title_width": 0,
          "selected_line": 0,
          "lock_text": false,
          "dont_wrap": false,
          "auto_tab": false,
          "wide_margins": false,
          "show_lines": false,
