          "script": "on keyDown key\nput empty into bg field (currentLevel() & \"_map\")\nput word 2 of the selectedChunk into charIndex\n\nif key is in \"123456789\" then\nif char charIndex of me is in \"123456789\" or ¬\nchar charIndex-1 of me is in \"123456789\" then\nexit keyDown\nend if\n\npass keyDown\nend if\n\nif charToNum(key) ≠ 127 then\npass keyDown\nend if\n\nif char charIndex of me is in \"123456789\" then\nselect char charIndex to charIndex of me\ntype numToChar(8)\nexit keyDown\nend if\n\nif char charIndex-1 of me is in \"123456789\" then\nselect char charIndex-1 to charIndex-1 of me\ntype numToChar(8)\nexit keyDown\nend if\n\nif char charIndex-2 of me is in \"123456789\" then\nselect char charIndex-2 to charIndex-2 of me\ntype numToChar(8)\nexit keyDown\nend if\n\nend keyDown",
