          "script": "on mouseDown\nglobal tilesFieldDidSomething\nput false into tilesFieldDidSomething\n\nrepeat until the mouse is up\nhandleMousePress the mouseH, the mouseV\nput true into tilesFieldDidSomething\nend repeat\nend mouseDown\n\non mouseUp\nglobal tilesFieldDidSomething\n\nif not tilesFieldDidSomething then\nhandleMousePress the clickH, the clickV\nend if\nend mouseUp\n\non handleMousePress x, y\nput (x - 4 - left of me) div 16 + 1 into xi\nput (y - 1 - top of me) div 16 + 1 into yi\n\nif xi ≤ 0 or xi > 4 or yi ≤ 0 or yi > the number of lines of me then\nexit handleMousePress\nend if\n\nput tilePosToTile(xi, yi) into tile\nsetCurrentTile tile\nend handleMousePress\n\nfunction findTile targetTile\nput charToNum(targetTile) into targetTileNum\n\nrepeat with y = 1 to the number of lines of me\nput 1 into column\nput 1 into x\nrepeat while x ≤ the number of chars of line y of me\nput char x of line y of me into tile\n\nif charToNum(tile) = targetTileNum then\nreturn column & \",\" & x & \",\" & y\nend if\n\nif tile is in \"12345679\" then\nadd 1 to x\nend if\n\nadd 1 to x\nadd 1 to column\nend repeat\nend repeat\n\nreturn empty\nend findTile\n\nfunction tilePosToTile xi, yi\nput line yi of me into tileLine\nput 1 into charIndex\nput 1 into charPosition\n\nrepeat while charIndex ≤ the number of chars of tileLine\nif xi = charPosition then\nexit repeat\nend if\n\nif char charIndex of tileLine is in \"123456789\" then\nadd 2 to charIndex\nelse\nadd 1 to charIndex\nend if\n\nadd 1 to charPosition\nend repeat\n\nreturn char charIndex of tileLine\nend tilePosToTile\n\non setCurrentTile tile\nglobal currentEditorTile\n\nput findTile(tile) into tilePosData\n\nif tilePosData is empty then\nreturn false\nend if\n\nput item 1 of tilePosData into column\nput item 2 of tilePosData into xi\nput item 3 of tilePosData into yi\n\nif yi ≤ 0 or yi > the number of lines of me then\nexit setCurrentTile\nend if\n\nif xi ≤ 0 or xi > the number of chars of line yi of me then\nexit setCurrentTile\nend if\n\nif column ≤ 0 or column > 4 then\nexit setCurrentTile\nend if\n\nput char xi of line yi of me into currentEditorTile\nshow button \"selected\"\nset left of button \"selected\" to (column-1)*16 + left of me + 4\nset top of button \"selected\" to (yi-1)*16 + top of me + 1\nreturn true\nend setCurrentTile\n",
          "visible": true,
          "style": "Rectangle",
          "text_font": "Sprites",
          "text_size": 16,
