          "script": "on mouseUp\nif visible of card field \"_levelOrder\" then\nshow card field currentLevel()\nhide card field \"_levelOrder\"\nhide card field \"_otherLevels\"\nhide button \"New level!\"\nexit mouseUp\nend if\n\nput empty into otherLevelNames\n\nrepeat with i = 1 to the number of card fields\nif \"_\" is in short name of card field i then next repeat\n\nput short name of card field i into ¬\nline (number of lines of otherLevelNames+1) of otherLevelNames\nend repeat\n\nsort lines of otherLevelNames\n\nput 1 into i\nrepeat while i ≤ the number of lines of otherLevelNames\nput false into deleteLine\nrepeat with j = 1 to the number of lines of card field \"_levelOrder\"\nif line i of otherLevelNames = line j of card field \"_levelOrder\" then\nput true into deleteLine\nexit repeat\nend if\nend repeat\n\nif deleteLine then\ndelete line i of otherLevelNames\nelse\nadd 1 to i\nend if\nend repeat\n\nput otherLevelNames into card field \"_otherLevels\"\n\nhide card field currentLevel()\nshow card field \"_otherLevels\"\nshow card field \"_levelOrder\"\nshow button \"New level!\"\nset lockText of card field \"_levelOrder\" to true\nset lockText of card field \"_otherLevels\" to true\nend mouseUp\n",
