        {
          "id": 54,
          "kind": "Button",
          "name": "rename",
          "rect": {
            "left": 438,
            "top": 317,
            "right": 477,
            "bottom": 330
          },
          "script": "on mouseUp\nglobal lastCurrentLevel\nask \"New level name:\" with currentLevel()\nif the result is cancel then exit mouseUp\n\nput currentLevel() into oldName\nput it into newName\nif currentLevel() = newName then exit mouseUp\n\nput id of card field oldName into editorMapId\nput id of card field (oldName & \"_name\") into nameId\nput id of bg field (oldName & \"_map\") into mapId\n\nput empty into cIds\nrepeat with i = 1 to 9\nput id of bg button (oldName & \"_c\" & i) into line i of cIds\nend repeat\n\nput empty into orderLine\n\nrepeat with i = 1 to the number of lines of card field \"_levelOrder\"\nif line i of card field \"_levelOrder\" = oldName then\nput i into orderLine\nexit repeat\nend if\nend repeat\n\nset name of card field id editorMapId to newName\nset name of card field id nameId to (newName & \"_name\")\nset name of bg field id mapId to (newName & \"_map\")\n\nrepeat with i = 1 to 9\nset name of bg button id (line i of cIds) to (newName & \"_c\" & i)\nend repeat\n\nif orderLine ≠ empty then\nput newName into line orderLine of card field \"_levelOrder\"\nend if\n\nput empty into lastCurrentLevel\nend mouseUp",
          "visible": true,
          "style": "Rectangle",
          "text_font": "Geneva",
          "text_size": 9,
          "text_style": "plain",
          "text_align": "Center",
          "contents": "",
          "hilite": false,
          "auto_hilite": true,
          "show_name": true,
