          "contents": "boing\nwall boing\ndeathy spikes\nmore boing\nboing diagonally\nsymmetrical\ninconvenient\navoid death when possible\nboing carefully\nboing boards\nirritating boing boards\na long way to fall\nadvanced boing boards\nbeep boop\nleverage\nso close and yet so far\nlonely in the sea\ndoors of doom\nlong climb\nfinal level\nextra challenge",
