        {
          "id": 73,
          "kind": "Button",
          "name": "style",
          "rect": {
            "left": 475,
            "top": 266,
            "right": 499,
            "bottom": 278
          },
          "script": "on mouseUp\nput \"Dark,16\" & return ¬\n& \"Light,17\" & return ¬\n& \"Medium 1,18\" & return ¬\n& \"Medium 2,19\" & return ¬\n& \"Medium 3,20\" & return ¬\n& \"Dramatic,21\" into styles\n\nput the textSize of card field currentLevel() into currentSize\n\nput empty into styleNames\nput 1 into currentStyle\n\nrepeat with i = 1 to the number of lines of styles\nput item 1 of line i of styles into line i of styleNames\n\nif currentSize = item 2 of line i of styles then\nput i into currentStyle\nend if\nend repeat\n\nask \"Theme (Dark, Light, Medium 1, Medium 2, Medium 3 or Dramatic):\" ¬\nwith line currentStyle of styleNames\nif it is empty then exit mouseUp\nput empty into themeIndex\nrepeat with i = 1 to the number of lines of styleNames\nif line i of styleNames = it then put i into themeIndex\nend repeat\nif themeIndex is empty then exit mouseUp\nput item 2 of line themeIndex of styles into newSize\n\nset textSize of card field currentLevel() to newSize\nset textSize of card field \"_tiles1\" to newSize\nset textSize of card field \"_tiles2\" to newSize\nset textSize of card field \"_tiles3\" to newSize\n\nend mouseUp",
          "visible": true,
          "style": "Rectangle",
          "text_font": "Geneva",
          "text_size": 9,
          "text_style": "plain",
          "text_align": "Center",
